  "steps": [
    "<strong>Crispy Tofu:</strong> Toss pressed tofu with soy sauce or tamari, cornstarch, garlic powder, and white pepper until well coated.",
    "Air-fry at 200°C / 400°F for 15–18 minutes, shaking halfway, or pan-fry in oil until deeply golden and crisp on all sides.",
    "<strong>Salad Base:</strong> In a large bowl, combine salad leaves, cucumber, spring onions, kimchi, sliced pear or apple, herbs, and nuts.",
    "<strong>Dressing:</strong> Whisk kimchi juice, rice vinegar, maple syrup, sesame oil, gochujang, garlic or ginger, and chilli flakes until emulsified.",
    "Toss salad with dressing just to coat. Top with hot crispy tofu and finish with sesame seeds."
  ],
  "tips": [
    "White pepper + garlic powder give tofu a subtle savoury depth without burning.",
    "Fruit sounds odd — it’s not. It balances heat and funk perfectly.",
    "Keep tofu separate until serving so it stays loud and crunchy."
